		{"id":"c5","type":"file","file":"process/influencers/README.md","x":840,"y":360,"width":300,"height":140},
		{"id":"focus","type":"text","text":"**One channel at a time.**\n\nmeta-ads is the focus. The other four are folders and nothing else — no steps, no TODOs, no half-written strategy. A channel that is not being worked collects stale notes, and stale notes get believed.\n\nA channel opens when the one before it has a repeatable winner, not when it looks interesting.","x":-40,"y":620,"width":580,"height":240,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"shape","type":"text","text":"**To open a channel:** copy the shape of `meta-ads/` — a `README.md` with the loop and the gates, one canvas seen from above, one `NN Step Name/` folder per tile holding its documentation, its `NN TODO.md` and whatever it produces.\n\nSteps and numbering are per channel. Do not reuse Meta's nine steps unquestioned — TikTok's creative loop is faster, and an influencer brief is a different job from a media buy.","x":560,"y":620,"width":620,"height":240,"color":"6"}
	],
